OL,3,GNEWSAEx-miners 'deflated' over pension
OL,4,Afunds after Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, Chancellor John Healey
OL,7,Fsaid the 50-50 agreement would end and
OL,8,Fsurplus cash would be paid to pension
OL,9,Fholders, but stopped short of
OL,10,Fannouncing the release of remaining
OL,11,Fcash held in the pension scheme.
